# A carriage return inside a value is kept by GLib.
-- input.cnf.esc --
[mydumper]\nwhere=a\rb\n
-- diagnostics --
2:8-2:9 warning MDL103[carriage-return] carriage return that is not part of a line ending: GLib keeps it in the text
  = The carriage return becomes part of the key, value or name on this line, which then no longer matches what you wrote.
